        <profile name="Living Lightning" id="b23c-448a-ac40-33f6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this model (excluding units with the Lone Operative ability that are not part of an Attached unit and are not within 12&quot; of this model) and roll four D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
