              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after the bearer has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks (excluding ^^**Titanic^^** units); until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is pinned. While a unit is pinned, subtract 2 from that unit’s Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that unit.</characteristic>
